# ADR-0052 / SpellAbilityRestriction.java:359-361: an Aftermath half is cast
# only from the graveyard. Ribbons ({X}{B}{B}) with X=1 drains the opponent for
# 1, and the card is exiled as it leaves the stack.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
